  "source": "Amazon Creator Connections — Sponsored Products for Creators (SPCC), Accepted tab, type=spcc; catalog 2026-09-29. No Affiliate+ campaigns are included. name + image from the Creators API getItems lookup (scripts/automation/amazon-lookup.cjs). Price deliberately not stored: the sponsored rail unit shows no price.",
  "campaignType": "spcc",
